  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1476/223/backpacked_banner-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"960\" height=\"180\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252fnet%252fminecraftforge%252fforge%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/793/502/_x__xampp_htdocs_mrcrayfish.png\" alt=\"Forge\" width=\"99\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffabricmc.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/793/503/_x__xampp_htdocs_mrcrayfish.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"105\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fneoforged.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/793/501/_x__xampp_htdocs_mrcrayfish.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"127\" height=\"28\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/framework\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/793/504/mrcrayfish.png\" alt=\"需要Framework\" width=\"222\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.mrcrayfish.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/793/500/_x__xampp_htdocs_mrcrayfish.png\" alt=\"MrCrayfish网站\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/MrCrayfishMinecraft\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/793/499/_x__xampp_htdocs_mrcrayfish.png\" alt=\"MrCrayfish的YouTube频道\" width=\"119\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/mrcrayfish\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/336389026586165261?label=&amp;color=2d2d2d&amp;labelColor=dddddd&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Discord&amp;logoColor=902121\" alt=\"MrCrayfish的Discord\"></a></p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\">Backpacked 3.0.0现已推出！</h1><p><del style=\"text-align:center\">预定2026年1月21日发布</del></p><p>我会尽快更新此描述，抱歉 - MrCrayfish</p><p>🏘️&nbsp;<strong>社区附加包</strong><br><em>这些附加包为您带来更多可发现的背包！</em></p><p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><strong>Backpacked: 贝壳</strong> <em>作者：Beast135</em> <br>(<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/backpacked-shells\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/backpacked-shells</a>)<br>添加两款新背包供解锁：蜗牛壳背包和鹦鹉螺壳背包<br><br><strong>Backpacked: 色彩世界</strong> <em>作者：Beast135</em> <br>(<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/backpacked-world-of-color)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/backpacked-world-of-color)</a><br>为标准背包添加多种染色变体</p><p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><strong>MrCrayfish的家具模组：翻新版</strong> <em>作者：MrCrayfish</em> <br>(<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/refurbished-furniture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/refurbished-furniture</a>)<br>当此模组与Backpacked一同安装时，会添加一款专属的储物柜背包。&nbsp;</p><p>🙋‍♀️ <strong>需要帮助？加入官方Discord服务器：</strong></p><p>评论区不适合寻求帮助，加入官方Discord服务器。您可在此获得模组安装与配置协助、解决崩溃问题等！此外，您还能第一时间获取模组更新与开发动态（比其他渠道更早）。&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/mrcrayfish\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/794/808/img.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"195\" height=\"28\"></a></p>",
